flowchart LR
    classDef ext fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#3a6ea5,color:#000
    classDef proc fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#b08400,color:#000
    classDef store fill:#f3d6f5,stroke:#6a1b9a,color:#000
    classDef ui fill:#ffe0d6,stroke:#bf360c,color:#000

    YF[Yahoo / CoinGecko]:::ext --> DI[DataIngestion 30-60s]:::proc
    DI --> KV1[(kv: horizon:price:SYM)]:::store
    DI --> OHLCV[(ohlcv table)]:::store
    OHLCV --> FE[FeatureEngine 23 indicators]:::proc
    FE --> FS[(feature_snapshots)]:::store
    FS --> SA[StrategyAgent 4 sleeves]:::proc
    SA -->|SIGNAL| RA[RiskAgent gates]:::proc
    RA -->|approved| PA[PortfolioAgent sizing]:::proc
    PA -->|ORDER_NEW| EA[ExecutionAgent]:::proc
    EA --> PB[PaperBroker AC-impact]:::proc
    KV1 --> PB
    PB -->|fill| EA
    EA --> ATX[Atomic txn]:::proc
    ATX --> ORD[(orders)]:::store
    ATX --> FIL[(fills)]:::store
    ATX --> POS[(positions)]:::store
    ATX --> CASH[(cash_balances)]:::store
    POS --> PM[PositionMonitor 30s mark-to-market]:::proc
    PM --> POS
    PA --> SNAP[NAV snapshot 60s]:::proc
    SNAP --> PSNP[(portfolio_snapshots)]:::store
    PSNP --> TUI[Terminal Dashboard]:::ui
    POS --> TUI
    FIL --> TUI
    PM -->|stop-loss SIGNAL| RA
